  {
   "id": "captions",
   "label": "Captions",
   "items": [
    {
     "id": "t000",
     "label": "Normal people can't build a physique like this.",
     "start": 27.407,
     "end": 29.867,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t001",
     "label": "You skip the drinks,",
     "start": 30.067,
     "end": 30.967,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t002",
     "label": "you say no to the pizza your friends are",
     "start": 31.187,
     "end": 33.107,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t003",
     "label": "eating, and tonight everyone's calling you obsessed and abnormal.",
     "start": 33.147,
     "end": 36.747,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t004",
     "label": "So is something actually wrong with you?",
     "start": 36.907,
     "end": 38.767,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t005",
     "label": "Actually, yes.",
     "start": 38.96,
     "end": 39.96,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t006",
     "label": "You are not normal,",
     "start": 40.253,
     "end": 41.033,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t007",
     "label": "and that's the point.",
     "start": 41.633,
     "end": 42.473,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t008",
     "label": "Success is abnormal by definition.",
     "start": 42.62,
     "end": 44.78,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t009",
     "label": "Successful people are outliers.",
     "start": 44.893,
     "end": 46.693,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t010",
     "label": "They do not belong to the average.",
     "start": 47.093,
     "end": 48.773,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t011",
     "label": "Which sounds great, except it comes with a price",
     "start": 48.947,
     "end": 51.473,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t012",
     "label": "most people won't pay.",
     "start": 51.613,
     "end": 52.633,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t013",
     "label": "Pain, discomfort, going further than most people could ever",
     "start": 52.76,
     "end": 56.093,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t014",
     "label": "tolerate.",
     "start": 56.153,
     "end": 56.693,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t015",
     "label": "That's why balance does not hold up while you",
     "start": 56.82,
     "end": 59.04,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t016",
     "label": "are chasing a big goal.",
     "start": 59.08,
     "end": 60.14,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t017",
     "label": "Balance is something everybody can do,",
     "start": 60.32,
     "end": 62.1,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t018",
     "label": "and if everybody can do it,",
     "start": 62.46,
     "end": 63.66,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t019",
     "label": "there's no value in it.",
     "start": 64.04,
     "end": 65.14,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t020",
     "label": "It's like a class where everybody gets an A.",
     "start": 65.254,
     "end": 67.434,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t021",
     "label": "The A means nothing.",
     "start": 67.64,
     "end": 68.66,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t022",
     "label": "Screw balance.",
     "start": 68.833,
     "end": 69.594,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t023",
     "label": "You need to go all out.",
     "start": 69.793,
     "end": 70.874,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t024",
     "label": "But here's the problem.",
     "start": 71.007,
     "end": 72.347,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t025",
     "label": "The moment it gets uncomfortable is the exact moment",
     "start": 72.647,
     "end": 75.667,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t026",
     "label": "you have to keep going.",
     "start": 75.727,
     "end": 76.707,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t027",
     "label": "That discomfort is what makes you grow It tells",
     "start": 76.867,
     "end": 79.353,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t028",
     "label": "your body and mind there's no option but to",
     "start": 79.393,
     "end": 82.133,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t029",
     "label": "adapt and become stronger.",
     "start": 82.214,
     "end": 83.513,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t030",
     "label": "And it's exactly where most people chicken out and",
     "start": 83.66,
     "end": 86.22,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t031",
     "label": "crawl back into comfort.",
     "start": 86.4,
     "end": 87.74,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t032",
     "label": "Outliers keep going, and that is when the judging",
     "start": 87.887,
     "end": 90.707,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t033",
     "label": "starts.",
     "start": 90.807,
     "end": 91.187,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t034",
     "label": "Normal people don't look at themselves.",
     "start": 91.367,
     "end": 93.207,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t035",
     "label": "They look at you.",
     "start": 93.407,
     "end": 94.147,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t036",
     "label": "Crazy, boring, obsessed, whatever helps them feel better about",
     "start": 94.24,
     "end": 97.947,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t037",
     "label": "their own mediocrity You,",
     "start": 97.987,
     "end": 99.133,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    },
    {
     "id": "t038",
     "label": "my friend, were never supposed to be normal",
     "start": 99.234,
     "end": 101.334,
     "anchor": "edit",
     "detail": ""
    }
   ]
  },
